OL,3,GNEWSACouple find love aged 88 in
OL,4,Aretirement village
OL,5,
OL,6,FNeither Barbara Thompson nor Fred
OL,7,FJenkins thought that love would be on
OL,8,Fthe cards for them again after the
OL,9,Fdeath of their spouses.
OL,11,FHowever, a meeting at the gym in their
OL,12,Fretirement village in Sutton Coldfield
OL,13,Fsparked a romance which has brought a
OL,14,Fwhole new adventure into their lives.
OL,16,FBarbara, aged 88, said "I was asked if
OL,17,FI would go with a friend [to the gym]
OL,18,Fto do toning up exercises, which I've
OL,19,Falways liked doing.
OL,21,F"She gave up and I carried on and
OL,22,Fthat's how I got to know Fred."
